id: pm-slack-standup-maint1014
title: Enable the gated GitHub issue sync and drop the braces chain
description: Enable the SHA-pinned fail-closed issue sync caller and remove fast-glob by adopting published pm-ops 2026.10.14. Keep existing thresholds and verify isolated npm and Bun release gates. This combined maintenance chore implements the dependency remediation tracked by pm-slack-standup-2sjh and leaves those items open for verification.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: changed
created_at: "2026-10-14T10:10:55.397Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-17T09:45:00.341Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T10:11:06.341Z",codex-agent,"Plan: author this package own thin caller, pin workflow SHA and pm-github to 2026.10.13, and verify isolated npm/Bun release gates without changing thresholds. Remove fast-glob and any jscpd4 alias; pin pm-ops 2026.10.14. Published changelog reviewed: attestation alias/function rejection, read-only pack prepare, release repair and Windows proof support. Duplication now uses Node glob with jscpd 5. No workflow dispatch, bot requests, merges, or source function changes."
  "2026-10-14T10:11:58.359Z",codex-agent,"Audit before: full 4 vulnerabilities (4 high), production 0. After: full 0, production 0; npm ls braces is empty. The caller runs at 17 2 * * * UTC. It validates access, previews the complete plan, imports with --gate, verifies repeat-import idempotency and privacy, then checks strict health before commit/push/PR. SHA pin matches published pm-github 2026.10.13. Actionlint skipped: binary missing and offline npx registry metadata unavailable. GitHub Actions PR-creation setting verified enabled. No direct fast-glob imports in authored scripts. The package prepare contract will be checked independently."
  "2026-10-14T10:13:06.282Z",codex-agent,"Adapted this package own prepare launcher to the published artifact-time contract by editing its original source, without copying another consumer repo file. Added a regression for pack/publish with pinned and stale installers: exit 0, one skip notice, byte-identical Git config. Focused regression passes 1/1; reverting only the launcher makes it fail, then fixed source restored. Existing install/ci failure checks remain covered."
  "2026-10-14T11:35:13.968Z",codex-agent,"npm release:check passed the 256-test primary suite and the later acceptance check. Bun primary suite passed 253/256: packed acceptance hit a process timeout and an npm ECONNRESET, and a local HTTPS synthetic 503 receipt instead saw ECONNRESET. Those same cases passed under npm. No code or threshold change is justified yet; rerun the failed Bun release gate and inspect any repeated failure before publication."
  "2026-10-14T11:45:50.203Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: npm: 257/257 tests passed, 0 skipped (test runs: 256 + 1); bun: 257/257 tests passed, 0 skipped (test runs: 256 + 1). Both isolated release:check gates passed at unchanged thresholds. Full audit 0, production audit 0, npm ls braces empty. Caller identity check reports only unbraind/pm-github. Behavioural revert proof: artifact-prepare regression passes 1/1 and fails when only the previous launcher is restored. Changelog regenerated and checked. Actionlint unavailable offline as recorded above. Item stays in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-17T09:45:00.340Z",codex-agent,"Repeated the integration instability already recorded here while validating the action-pin repair in pm-slack-standup-6wvl: the initial Node 24 release gate passed 255/258 tests; two packed matrices exceeded their existing deadlines and the synthetic HTTPS 503 fixture received ECONNRESET. All four action-pin tests passed. PR 131 CI passes 258/258 with 100 percent coverage on Node 22.18.0 and 26. Retrying local npm and Bun release gates with the installed CI runtime and two-CPU affinity; no test timeout, threshold or product change is included. Root cause of the integration instability remains outside the action-pin repair."
